OL,3,GNEWSAChildline Liverpool staff 'deeply
OL,4,Asaddened' by death of Esther Rantzen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA manager at Childline Liverpool has
OL,7,Fpaid tribute to the charity's
OL,8,F"wonderful" founder Dame Esther
OL,9,FRantzen.
OL,11,FDame Esther, who presented BBC One's
OL,12,Fshow That's Life! for 21 years and
OL,13,Flaunched the charity counselling
OL,14,Fservice for young people 40 years ago,
OL,15,Fdied on Wednesday at the age of 86.
OL,17,FDame Esther hosted and produced the
OL,18,Fprogramme from 1973 to 1994 which
OL,19,Fregularly attracted 20m viewers for its
OL,20,Fmix of serious consumer investigations
OL,21,Fand light-hearted items.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
