OL,3,GNEWSAChildline Liverpool staff 'deeply
OL,4,Asaddened' by death of Esther Rantzen
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarian Blackburn, a team leader at
OL,7,FChildline Liverpool, said the star was
OL,8,F"kind, compassionate and formidable"
OL,9,Fand everyone was "deeply saddened" at
OL,10,Fthe news.
